  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East European Foundation Moldova: Impact Space 2024-2028</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">East European Foundation Moldova: Impact Space 2024-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective/impact

Vulnerable women and men are more empowered and benefit from better employment opportunities provided by social enterprises.

Specific Objectives/outcomes:

The project will achieve four outcomes:
Outcome 1. (Policy advocacy) The legal and policy frameworks on social entrepreneurship are improved
Outcome 2. (Capacity building) Capacities of prospective and existing social entrepreneurs are strengthened
Outcome 3. (Impact Fund for Social Entrepreneurship) Social entrepreneurs increasingly implement impact initiatives designed to facilitate employment and improve livelihoods of most vulnerable groups
Outcome 4. (Impact ecosystem) Preconditions are in place to create a thriving ecosystem of social enterprises through the Impact Hub</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Initiativet, med titeln &quot;Impact Space&quot;, &#xE4;r utformat f&#xF6;r att skapa ett st&#xF6;djande ekosystem f&#xF6;r sociala f&#xF6;retag, utrusta dem med n&#xF6;dv&#xE4;ndiga verktyg, resurser och n&#xE4;tverk f&#xF6;r att frodas och skapa meningsfull social p&#xE5;verkan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative, titled &#x201C;Impact Space&#x201D;, is designed to establish a supportive ecosystem for social enterprises, equipping them with the necessary tools, resources and networks to thrive and create meaningful social impact.</narrative>
  </description>
